<!-- T3 虚拟化连续阅读视图：VirtualizingStackPanel 承载惰性页容器（可见页 ± 缓冲页渲染，其余骨架占位）
     + 状态栏（页码跳转 / 九档缩放阶梯 / 适配宽度·页面）。
     T2 增设：拖选叠加层 + 选中浮菜单（复制/高亮/笔记/用工具处理▾）+ 悬停编辑/删除/改色 + 笔记输入 + Toast。
     布局与视觉沿用 App.xaml 应用级设计 token（色板 / 字号阶梯 / 4 的倍数间距网格），不新增浮菜单专用 token（Q12）。 -->
<!-- V3 T9（C1）：虚拟化单元由「一页一项」改为「对页组一项」（仅对开模式生效；单页模式 group == page）。
     组容器承载鼠标/选择/命中，组内点经 ReaderViewModel 的 page↔group 映射回传页索引与页局部坐标；
     仅可视 ± 缓冲组持位图；状态栏新增「单页/双页」切换。 -->
<UserControl x:Class="AIPDF.Windows.Views.Reader.ReaderView"
             xmlns="http://schemas.microsoft.com/winfx/2006/xaml/presentation"
             xmlns:x="http://schemas.microsoft.com/winfx/2006/xaml"
             xmlns:reader="clr-namespace:AIPDF.Windows.Views.Reader"
             xmlns:vm="clr-namespace:AIPDF.Windows.ViewModels"
             xmlns:annotations="clr-namespace:AIPDF.Windows.Annotations"
             MinWidth="480"
             MinHeight="240"
             Focusable="True"
             PreviewKeyDown="OnPreviewKeyDown">

    <UserControl.Resources>
        <BooleanToVisibilityConverter x:Key="BoolToVisibility" />

        <!-- A+C 方案 A（底栏合一）：ZoomButton / FitWidthButton / FitPageButton / SpreadButton /
             JumpBoxStyle 已提升到 App.xaml —— 对应控件移入主窗口状态栏，阅读视图内部不再有底栏。 -->

        <!-- T2 浮菜单/悬停操作条：与右抽屉同一视觉语言（App 级色板 + SecondaryButton 基类） -->
        <Style x:Key="FlyoutPanel" TargetType="Border">
            <Setter Property="Background" Value="{DynamicResource Brush.Window}" />
            <Setter Property="BorderBrush" Value="{DynamicResource Brush.Border}" />
            <Setter Property="BorderThickness" Value="1" />
            <Setter Property="CornerRadius" Value="6" />
            <Setter Property="Padding" Value="4" />
        </Style>

        <!-- 菜单项：扁平、左对齐、悬停用全局 Hover 底色（同一视觉语言，不新增 token） -->
        <Style x:Key="MenuItemButton" TargetType="Button" BasedOn="{StaticResource SecondaryButton}">
            <Setter Property="HorizontalContentAlignment" Value="Left" />
            <Setter Property="Background" Value="Transparent" />
            <Setter Property="BorderThickness" Value="0" />
            <Setter Property="Padding" Value="12,7" />
            <Setter Property="MinWidth" Value="148" />
            <Setter Property="Margin" Value="0" />
            <Setter Property="ToolTipService.ShowOnDisabled" Value="True" />
            <Style.Triggers>
                <Trigger Property="IsMouseOver" Value="True">
                    <Setter Property="Background" Value="{DynamicResource Brush.Hover}" />
                </Trigger>
                <Trigger Property="IsEnabled" Value="False">
                    <Setter Property="Foreground" Value="{DynamicResource Brush.TextTertiary}" />
                </Trigger>
            </Style.Triggers>
        </Style>

        <!-- 色板色块 -->
        <Style x:Key="ColorSwatchButton" TargetType="Button" BasedOn="{StaticResource SecondaryButton}">
            <Setter Property="Width" Value="30" />
            <Setter Property="Height" Value="30" />
            <Setter Property="Padding" Value="0" />
            <Setter Property="Margin" Value="4,0,0,0" />
            <Setter Property="BorderBrush" Value="{DynamicResource Brush.Border}" />
            <Setter Property="BorderThickness" Value="1" />
        </Style>

        <!-- ============ V3 T11（C3）绘制工具栏样式 ============ -->

        <!-- 绘制工具/粗细切换钮（RadioButton 呈现为方形切换钮；选中用 AccentSoft） -->
        <Style x:Key="DrawChoiceButton" TargetType="RadioButton">
            <Setter Property="Height" Value="26" />
            <Setter Property="Margin" Value="2,0,0,0" />
            <Setter Property="Foreground" Value="{DynamicResource Brush.TextPrimary}" />
            <Setter Property="Cursor" Value="Hand" />
            <Setter Property="Template">
                <Setter.Value>
                    <ControlTemplate TargetType="RadioButton">
                        <Border x:Name="Bg"
                                Background="Transparent"
                                BorderBrush="{DynamicResource Brush.Border}"
                                BorderThickness="1"
                                CornerRadius="4">
                            <ContentPresenter HorizontalAlignment="Center"
                                              VerticalAlignment="Center"
                                              Margin="8,0" />
                        </Border>
                        <ControlTemplate.Triggers>
                            <Trigger Property="IsChecked" Value="True">
                                <Setter TargetName="Bg" Property="Background" Value="{DynamicResource Brush.AccentSoft}" />
                                <Setter TargetName="Bg" Property="BorderBrush" Value="{DynamicResource Brush.Accent}" />
                            </Trigger>
                            <Trigger Property="IsMouseOver" Value="True">
                                <Setter TargetName="Bg" Property="Background" Value="{DynamicResource Brush.Hover}" />
                            </Trigger>
                        </ControlTemplate.Triggers>
                    </ControlTemplate>
                </Setter.Value>
            </Setter>
        </Style>

        <!-- 颜色色块（RadioButton）：Background 即所选颜色，选中加粗 Accent 边框 -->
        <Style x:Key="DrawColorSwatch" TargetType="RadioButton">
            <Setter Property="Width" Value="24" />
            <Setter Property="Height" Value="24" />
            <Setter Property="Margin" Value="3,0,0,0" />
            <Setter Property="Cursor" Value="Hand" />
            <Setter Property="BorderBrush" Value="{DynamicResource Brush.Border}" />
            <Setter Property="BorderThickness" Value="1" />
            <Setter Property="Template">
                <Setter.Value>
                    <ControlTemplate TargetType="RadioButton">
                        <Border Background="{TemplateBinding Background}"
                                BorderBrush="{TemplateBinding BorderBrush}"
                                BorderThickness="{TemplateBinding BorderThickness}"
                                CornerRadius="4" />
                    </ControlTemplate>
                </Setter.Value>
            </Setter>
            <Style.Triggers>
                <Trigger Property="IsChecked" Value="True">
                    <Setter Property="BorderBrush" Value="{DynamicResource Brush.Accent}" />
                    <Setter Property="BorderThickness" Value="2" />
                </Trigger>
            </Style.Triggers>
        </Style>

        <!-- 绘制总开关（ToggleButton；开启时高亮） -->
        <Style x:Key="DrawModeToggle" TargetType="ToggleButton">
            <Setter Property="Height" Value="26" />
            <Setter Property="Padding" Value="10,0" />
            <Setter Property="Foreground" Value="{DynamicResource Brush.TextPrimary}" />
            <Setter Property="Cursor" Value="Hand" />
            <Setter Property="Template">
                <Setter.Value>
                    <ControlTemplate TargetType="ToggleButton">
                        <Border x:Name="Bg"
                                Background="{DynamicResource Brush.Surface}"
                                BorderBrush="{DynamicResource Brush.Border}"
                                BorderThickness="1"
                                CornerRadius="4">
                            <ContentPresenter HorizontalAlignment="Center"
                                              VerticalAlignment="Center"
                                              Margin="10,0" />
                        </Border>
                        <ControlTemplate.Triggers>
                            <Trigger Property="IsChecked" Value="True">
                                <Setter TargetName="Bg" Property="Background" Value="{DynamicResource Brush.Accent}" />
                                <Setter TargetName="Bg" Property="BorderBrush" Value="{DynamicResource Brush.Accent}" />
                                <Setter Property="Foreground" Value="{DynamicResource Brush.OnAccent}" />
                            </Trigger>
                            <Trigger Property="IsMouseOver" Value="True">
                                <Setter TargetName="Bg" Property="Background" Value="{DynamicResource Brush.Hover}" />
                            </Trigger>
                        </ControlTemplate.Triggers>
                    </ControlTemplate>
                </Setter.Value>
            </Setter>
        </Style>

        <!-- 工具栏外框：仅在已打开文档时出现 -->
        <Style x:Key="DrawToolbarPanel" TargetType="Border" BasedOn="{StaticResource FlyoutPanel}">
            <Setter Property="Visibility" Value="Collapsed" />
            <Style.Triggers>
                <DataTrigger Binding="{Binding HasDocument}" Value="True">
                    <Setter Property="Visibility" Value="Visible" />
                </DataTrigger>
            </Style.Triggers>
        </Style>
    </UserControl.Resources>

    <Grid>
        <Grid.RowDefinitions>
            <RowDefinition Height="*" />
            <RowDefinition Height="Auto" />
        </Grid.RowDefinitions>

        <!-- ============ 阅读区 ============ -->
        <Grid Grid.Row="0">

            <!-- 空态（无文档） -->
            <StackPanel HorizontalAlignment="Center" VerticalAlignment="Center">
                <StackPanel.Style>
                    <Style TargetType="StackPanel">
                        <Setter Property="Visibility" Value="Visible" />
                        <Style.Triggers>
                            <DataTrigger Binding="{Binding HasDocument}" Value="True">
                                <Setter Property="Visibility" Value="Collapsed" />
                            </DataTrigger>
                        </Style.Triggers>
                    </Style>
                </StackPanel.Style>
                <TextBlock Text="{x:Static reader:ReaderStrings.EmptyStateTitle}"
                           Style="{StaticResource SectionTitle}"
                           HorizontalAlignment="Center" />
                <TextBlock Text="{x:Static reader:ReaderStrings.EmptyStateHint}"
                           Style="{StaticResource FieldHint}"
                           HorizontalAlignment="Center"
                           Margin="0,8,0,0" />
            </StackPanel>

            <!-- 虚拟化滚动承载：ScrollViewer(CanContentScroll) → ItemsControl → VirtualizingStackPanel。
                 ScrollUnit=Pixel 保证平滑滚动；CacheLength=0,0 关闭面板级额外实现，
                 渲染缓冲完全由 ViewModel 的可视页 ± 缓冲计算驱动（纯逻辑，可测）。 -->
            <ScrollViewer x:Name="ScrollHost"
                          CanContentScroll="True"
                          VerticalScrollBarVisibility="Auto"
                          HorizontalScrollBarVisibility="Disabled"
                          Background="{DynamicResource Brush.PreviewBg}"
                          PreviewMouseWheel="OnPreviewMouseWheel"
                          ScrollChanged="OnScrollChanged">
                <ScrollViewer.Style>
                    <Style TargetType="ScrollViewer">
                        <Setter Property="Visibility" Value="Collapsed" />
                        <Style.Triggers>
                            <DataTrigger Binding="{Binding HasDocument}" Value="True">
                                <Setter Property="Visibility" Value="Visible" />
                            </DataTrigger>
                        </Style.Triggers>
                    </Style>
                </ScrollViewer.Style>
                <!-- V3 T9：虚拟化单元 = 对页组（单页模式 group == page；对开 1–2 页/组）。
                     组容器承载鼠标/选择/命中事件——组内取点后经 page↔group 映射回传页索引与页局部坐标；
                     Background=Transparent 保证空白/位图区均可命中。仅可视 ± 缓冲组持位图（虚拟化不退化）。 -->
                <ItemsControl ItemsSource="{Binding Groups}"
                              HorizontalContentAlignment="Center"
                              VirtualizingPanel.IsVirtualizing="True"
                              VirtualizingPanel.VirtualizationMode="Standard"
                              VirtualizingPanel.ScrollUnit="Pixel"
                              VirtualizingPanel.CacheLength="0,0">
                    <!-- 显式声明虚拟化面板：默认 StackPanel 不会虚拟化，会一次性生成全部组容器（与 T3 设计/注释不符）。 -->
                    <ItemsControl.ItemsPanel>
                        <ItemsPanelTemplate>
                            <VirtualizingStackPanel />
                        </ItemsPanelTemplate>
                    </ItemsControl.ItemsPanel>
                    <ItemsControl.ItemTemplate>
                        <DataTemplate DataType="{x:Type vm:ReaderSpreadGroupViewModel}">
                            <!-- 对页组容器：宽高始终绑定组尺寸缓存换算值（骨架保持正确宽高比，避免跳动【ST-10】）；
                                 底部 16px 即 FR-01 组间距，与 PageLayoutCalculator.PageGap 一致。 -->
                            <Grid Width="{Binding DisplayWidth}"
                                  Height="{Binding DisplayHeight}"
                                  HorizontalAlignment="Center"
                                  VerticalAlignment="Top"
                                  Margin="0,0,0,16"
                                  Background="Transparent"
                                  MouseLeftButtonDown="OnGroupMouseLeftButtonDown"
                                  MouseMove="OnGroupMouseMove"
                                  MouseLeftButtonUp="OnGroupMouseLeftButtonUp"
                                  MouseLeave="OnGroupMouseLeave">
                                <!-- 组内页：Canvas 按页在组内偏移（OffsetX/OffsetY）水平排布；仅 1–2 页，无需虚拟化。
                                     叠加层（高亮/批注/选区）仍为页局部坐标，语义不变。 -->
                                <ItemsControl ItemsSource="{Binding Pages}"
                                              HorizontalAlignment="Left"
                                              VerticalAlignment="Top">
                                    <ItemsControl.ItemsPanel>
                                        <ItemsPanelTemplate>
                                            <Canvas />
                                        </ItemsPanelTemplate>
                                    </ItemsControl.ItemsPanel>
                                    <ItemsControl.ItemContainerStyle>
                                        <Style TargetType="ContentPresenter">
                                            <Setter Property="Canvas.Left" Value="{Binding OffsetX}" />
                                            <Setter Property="Canvas.Top" Value="{Binding OffsetY}" />
                                        </Style>
                                    </ItemsControl.ItemContainerStyle>
                                    <ItemsControl.ItemTemplate>
                                        <DataTemplate DataType="{x:Type vm:ReaderPageItemViewModel}">
                                            <!-- 惰性页容器：宽高绑定页尺寸缓存换算值（ST-10 骨架占位不跳动）。 -->
                                            <Grid Width="{Binding DisplayWidth}"
                                                  Height="{Binding DisplayHeight}">
                                <!-- 骨架占位：快速滚动未渲染页状态 -->
                                <Border Background="{DynamicResource Brush.Hover}"
                                        BorderBrush="{DynamicResource Brush.Border}"
                                        BorderThickness="1"
                                        CornerRadius="2">
                                    <Border.Style>
                                        <Style TargetType="Border">
                                            <Setter Property="Visibility" Value="Visible" />
                                            <Style.Triggers>
                                                <DataTrigger Binding="{Binding IsRendered}" Value="True">
                                                    <Setter Property="Visibility" Value="Collapsed" />
                                                </DataTrigger>
                                            </Style.Triggers>
                                        </Style>
                                    </Border.Style>
                                    <StackPanel HorizontalAlignment="Center" VerticalAlignment="Center">
                                        <TextBlock Text="{Binding Number, StringFormat=第 {0} 页}"
                                                   FontSize="13"
                                                   Foreground="{DynamicResource Brush.TextSecondary}" />
                                        <TextBlock Text="{x:Static reader:ReaderStrings.RenderingHint}"
                                                   FontSize="11"
                                                   Margin="0,4,0,0"
                                                   Foreground="{DynamicResource Brush.TextTertiary}">
                                            <TextBlock.Style>
                                                <Style TargetType="TextBlock">
                                                    <Setter Property="Visibility" Value="Visible" />
                                                    <Style.Triggers>
                                                        <DataTrigger Binding="{Binding IsRendering}" Value="False">
                                                            <Setter Property="Visibility" Value="Collapsed" />
                                                        </DataTrigger>
                                                    </Style.Triggers>
                                                </Style>
                                            </TextBlock.Style>
                                        </TextBlock>
                                    </StackPanel>
                                </Border>
                                <!-- 渲染位图：T1 后台线程产出（冻结），Stretch=Fill 精确填充 DIP 容器 -->
                                <Image Source="{Binding Bitmap}"
                                       Stretch="Fill"
                                       RenderOptions.BitmapScalingMode="HighQuality"
                                       Visibility="{Binding IsRendered, Converter={StaticResource BoolToVisibility}}" />
                                <!-- 搜索命中高亮叠加层（T8）：Canvas 绝对定位 DIP 矩形；IsHitTestVisible=False
                                     保证滚动/选中/缩放事件照常穿透；矩形随缩放重算（DisplayWidth 变化）。 -->
                                <ItemsControl ItemsSource="{Binding Highlights}"
                                              IsHitTestVisible="False"
                                              HorizontalAlignment="Left"
                                              VerticalAlignment="Top"
                                              Width="{Binding DisplayWidth}"
                                              Height="{Binding DisplayHeight}">
                                    <ItemsControl.ItemsPanel>
                                        <ItemsPanelTemplate>
                                            <Canvas />
                                        </ItemsPanelTemplate>
                                    </ItemsControl.ItemsPanel>
                                    <ItemsControl.ItemContainerStyle>
                                        <Style TargetType="ContentPresenter">
                                            <Setter Property="Canvas.Left" Value="{Binding X}" />
                                            <Setter Property="Canvas.Top" Value="{Binding Y}" />
                                        </Style>
                                    </ItemsControl.ItemContainerStyle>
                                    <ItemsControl.ItemTemplate>
                                        <DataTemplate>
                                            <Border Width="{Binding Width}"
                                                    Height="{Binding Height}"
                                                    IsHitTestVisible="False"
                                                    Background="{DynamicResource Brush.SearchHighlight}"
                                                    BorderBrush="{DynamicResource Brush.SearchHighlightBorder}"
                                                    BorderThickness="1" />
                                        </DataTemplate>
                                    </ItemsControl.ItemTemplate>
                                </ItemsControl>

                                <!-- V4 T8 朗读位置高亮：与搜索高亮同构（同一换算函数），
                                     用独立配色以便与搜索命中区分；随缩放重算。 -->
                                <ItemsControl ItemsSource="{Binding SpeechRects}"
                                              IsHitTestVisible="False"
                                              HorizontalAlignment="Left"
                                              VerticalAlignment="Top"
                                              Width="{Binding DisplayWidth}"
                                              Height="{Binding DisplayHeight}">
                                    <ItemsControl.ItemsPanel>
                                        <ItemsPanelTemplate>
                                            <Canvas />
                                        </ItemsPanelTemplate>
                                    </ItemsControl.ItemsPanel>
                                    <ItemsControl.ItemContainerStyle>
                                        <Style TargetType="ContentPresenter">
                                            <Setter Property="Canvas.Left" Value="{Binding X}" />
                                            <Setter Property="Canvas.Top" Value="{Binding Y}" />
                                        </Style>
                                    </ItemsControl.ItemContainerStyle>
                                    <ItemsControl.ItemTemplate>
                                        <DataTemplate>
                                            <Border Width="{Binding Width}"
                                                    Height="{Binding Height}"
                                                    IsHitTestVisible="False"
                                                    Background="{DynamicResource Brush.AccentSoft}"
                                                    BorderBrush="{DynamicResource Brush.Accent}"
                                                    BorderThickness="1"
                                                    CornerRadius="1" />
                                        </DataTemplate>
                                    </ItemsControl.ItemTemplate>
                                </ItemsControl>
                                <!-- 批注叠加层（V2 T1）：与搜索高亮层完全独立的 IsHitTestVisible=False 层，
                                     不改变搜索高亮语义；Canvas 绝对定位 DIP 矩形，随缩放由 VM 重算。
                                     Border 绑定 AnnotationOverlay.Fill/Border（已冻结 Brush）；Note 类型右上角画标记圆点。 -->
                                <ItemsControl ItemsSource="{Binding Annotations}"
                                              IsHitTestVisible="False"
                                              HorizontalAlignment="Left"
                                              VerticalAlignment="Top"
                                              Width="{Binding DisplayWidth}"
                                              Height="{Binding DisplayHeight}">
                                    <ItemsControl.ItemsPanel>
                                        <ItemsPanelTemplate>
                                            <Canvas />
                                        </ItemsPanelTemplate>
                                    </ItemsControl.ItemsPanel>
                                    <ItemsControl.ItemContainerStyle>
                                        <Style TargetType="ContentPresenter">
                                            <Setter Property="Canvas.Left" Value="{Binding X}" />
                                            <Setter Property="Canvas.Top" Value="{Binding Y}" />
                                        </Style>
                                    </ItemsControl.ItemContainerStyle>
                                    <ItemsControl.ItemTemplate>
                                        <DataTemplate>
                                            <Grid Width="{Binding Width}"
                                                  Height="{Binding Height}"
                                                  IsHitTestVisible="False">
                                                <!-- 高亮/笔记：矩形填充 + 边框 + 笔记圆点（V2 语义不变） -->
                                                <Grid x:Name="BoxLayer">
                                                    <Border Background="{Binding Fill}"
                                                            BorderBrush="{Binding Border}"
                                                            BorderThickness="1"
                                                            CornerRadius="1" />
                                                    <Ellipse Width="10"
                                                             Height="10"
                                                             HorizontalAlignment="Right"
                                                             VerticalAlignment="Top"
                                                             Margin="0,-5,-5,0"
                                                             Fill="{DynamicResource Brush.Accent}"
                                                             Stroke="{DynamicResource Brush.OnAccent}"
                                                             StrokeThickness="1">
                                                        <Ellipse.Style>
                                                            <Style TargetType="Ellipse">
                                                                <Setter Property="Visibility" Value="Collapsed" />
                                                                <Style.Triggers>
                                                                    <DataTrigger Binding="{Binding Kind}" Value="Note">
                                                                        <Setter Property="Visibility" Value="Visible" />
                                                                    </DataTrigger>
                                                                </Style.Triggers>
                                                            </Style>
                                                        </Ellipse.Style>
                                                    </Ellipse>
                                            </Grid>

                                                <!-- V3 T11（C3）：手写/形状几何（Path 描边）。
                                                     Geometry 由 AnnotationOverlay 构建并冻结，坐标相对条目左上角
                                                     （条目经 Canvas.Left/Top 定位到 X/Y），随缩放由 VM 重算。 -->
                                                <Path x:Name="ShapeLayer"
                                                      Data="{Binding Geometry}"
                                                      Stroke="{Binding Border}"
                                                      StrokeThickness="{Binding StrokeThickness}"
                                                      Fill="{Binding Fill}"
                                                      StrokeStartLineCap="Round"
                                                      StrokeEndLineCap="Round"
                                                      StrokeLineJoin="Round"
                                                      Visibility="Collapsed" />

                                                <!-- V4 T4：图章预览（未保存前）。
                                                     预置图章显示文字标签，图片图章显示图片；
                                                     保存后记录移出客户端模型，改由 PDF 内嵌注释渲染真实外观。 -->
                                                <Grid x:Name="StampLayer" Visibility="Collapsed">
                                                    <Border Background="{Binding Fill}"
                                                            BorderBrush="{Binding Border}"
                                                            BorderThickness="2"
                                                            CornerRadius="2" />
                                                    <TextBlock Text="{Binding Label}"
                                                               Foreground="{Binding Border}"
                                                               FontSize="14"
                                                               FontWeight="Bold"
                                                               HorizontalAlignment="Center"
                                                               VerticalAlignment="Center"
                                                               TextAlignment="Center"
                                                               TextWrapping="Wrap"
                                                               Margin="4" />
                                                    <Image Source="{Binding Image}" Stretch="Uniform" />
                                                </Grid>
                                            </Grid>
                                            <DataTemplate.Triggers>
                                                <!-- V4 T3：几何层由 AnnotationOverlay.UsesGeometryLayer 统一驱动
                                                     （Ink/Shape/Underline/Strikeout，以及多行高亮的逐行填充）；
                                                     Highlight/Note 的单矩形仍走 BoxLayer，保持 V2 渲染契约。 -->
                                                <DataTrigger Binding="{Binding UsesGeometryLayer}" Value="True">
                                                    <Setter TargetName="BoxLayer" Property="Visibility" Value="Collapsed" />
                                                    <Setter TargetName="ShapeLayer" Property="Visibility" Value="Visible" />
                                                </DataTrigger>
                                                <!-- V4 T4：图章走独立的预览层（BoxLayer 无文字/图片承载能力） -->
                                                <DataTrigger Binding="{Binding Kind}" Value="Stamp">
                                                    <Setter TargetName="BoxLayer" Property="Visibility" Value="Collapsed" />
                                                    <Setter TargetName="StampLayer" Property="Visibility" Value="Visible" />
                                                </DataTrigger>
                                            </DataTemplate.Triggers>
                                        </DataTemplate>
                                    </ItemsControl.ItemTemplate>
                                </ItemsControl>
                                <!-- v1.1 T19 替换标注叠加层：划词译文 sidecar 的只读投影，独立于批注层
                                     （不进批注保存管线、绝不写回源 PDF）。Canvas 绝对定位 DIP 矩形，
                                     IsHitTestVisible=False 保证滚动/选中/缩放事件穿透；配色走 A+C Brush.* token。 -->
                                <ItemsControl ItemsSource="{Binding TranslationOverlays}"
                                              IsHitTestVisible="False"
                                              HorizontalAlignment="Left"
                                              VerticalAlignment="Top"
                                              Width="{Binding DisplayWidth}"
                                              Height="{Binding DisplayHeight}">
                                    <ItemsControl.ItemsPanel>
                                        <ItemsPanelTemplate>
                                            <Canvas />
                                        </ItemsPanelTemplate>
                                    </ItemsControl.ItemsPanel>
                                    <ItemsControl.ItemContainerStyle>
                                        <Style TargetType="ContentPresenter">
                                            <Setter Property="Canvas.Left" Value="{Binding X}" />
                                            <Setter Property="Canvas.Top" Value="{Binding Y}" />
                                        </Style>
                                    </ItemsControl.ItemContainerStyle>
                                    <ItemsControl.ItemTemplate>
                                        <DataTemplate>
                                            <Border MinWidth="{Binding Width}"
                                                    MaxWidth="280"
                                                    Background="{DynamicResource Brush.AccentSoft}"
                                                    BorderBrush="{DynamicResource Brush.Accent}"
                                                    BorderThickness="1"
                                                    CornerRadius="3"
                                                    Padding="4,2"
                                                    IsHitTestVisible="False"
                                                    ToolTip="{Binding LangPair}">
                                                <TextBlock Text="{Binding Text}"
                                                           FontSize="11"
                                                           TextWrapping="Wrap"
                                                           Foreground="{DynamicResource Brush.AccentText}" />
                                            </Border>
                                        </DataTemplate>
                                    </ItemsControl.ItemTemplate>
                                </ItemsControl>
                                <!-- V3 T11（C3）：绘制中的临时预览几何（页局部 DIP；仅拖拽期非空）。
                                     独立于持久批注层，完成后由 code-behind 清空；Canvas 定位到预览包围盒原点。 -->
                                <Canvas IsHitTestVisible="False">
                                    <Path Canvas.Left="{Binding DrawPreviewX}"
                                          Canvas.Top="{Binding DrawPreviewY}"
                                          Data="{Binding DrawPreview}"
                                          Stroke="{DynamicResource Brush.Accent}"
                                          StrokeThickness="{Binding DrawPreviewThickness}"
                                          StrokeStartLineCap="Round"
                                          StrokeEndLineCap="Round"
                                          Fill="Transparent" />
                                </Canvas>
                                <!-- T2 选区叠加层：拖选中的临时矩形（DIP）。用全局 Accent 半透明填充，
                                     与搜索高亮的琥珀色/批注黄色区分；IsHitTestVisible=False 不阻塞拖选。 -->
                                <ItemsControl ItemsSource="{Binding SelectionRects}"
                                              IsHitTestVisible="False"
                                              HorizontalAlignment="Left"
                                              VerticalAlignment="Top"
                                              Width="{Binding DisplayWidth}"
                                              Height="{Binding DisplayHeight}">
                                    <ItemsControl.ItemsPanel>
                                        <ItemsPanelTemplate>
                                            <Canvas />
                                        </ItemsPanelTemplate>
                                    </ItemsControl.ItemsPanel>
                                    <ItemsControl.ItemContainerStyle>
                                        <Style TargetType="ContentPresenter">
                                            <Setter Property="Canvas.Left" Value="{Binding X}" />
                                            <Setter Property="Canvas.Top" Value="{Binding Y}" />
                                        </Style>
                                    </ItemsControl.ItemContainerStyle>
                                    <ItemsControl.ItemTemplate>
                                        <DataTemplate>
                                            <Border Width="{Binding Width}"
                                                    Height="{Binding Height}"
                                                    IsHitTestVisible="False"
                                                    Background="{DynamicResource Brush.Accent}"
                                                    BorderBrush="{DynamicResource Brush.Accent}"
                                                    BorderThickness="1"
                                                    Opacity="0.28" />
                                        </DataTemplate>
                                    </ItemsControl.ItemTemplate>
                                        </ItemsControl>
                                            </Grid>
                                        </DataTemplate>
                                    </ItemsControl.ItemTemplate>
                                </ItemsControl>
                            </Grid>
                        </DataTemplate>
                    </ItemsControl.ItemTemplate>
                </ItemsControl>
            </ScrollViewer>

            <!-- ============ V3 T11（C3）手写/形状绘制工具栏 ============
                 默认关闭（DrawModeToggle 未选），不影响既有「选中文字 → 高亮/笔记」浮菜单；
                 开启后在页面上拖拽绘制，可删除/改色（复用悬停操作条）。 -->
            <Border x:Name="DrawToolbar"
                    Style="{StaticResource DrawToolbarPanel}"
                    HorizontalAlignment="Right"
                    VerticalAlignment="Top"
                    Margin="0,12,12,0"
                    Padding="8,6"
                    Panel.ZIndex="6"
                    ToolTip="{x:Static reader:ReaderStrings.DrawToolbarToolTip}">
                <StackPanel Orientation="Horizontal" VerticalAlignment="Center">
                    <ToggleButton x:Name="DrawModeToggle"
                                  Style="{StaticResource DrawModeToggle}"
                                  Content="{x:Static reader:ReaderStrings.DrawModeLabel}"
                                  Checked="OnDrawModeChanged"
                                  Unchecked="OnDrawModeChanged" />
                    <Border Width="1" Margin="6,4" Background="{DynamicResource Brush.Border}" />
                    <RadioButton Style="{StaticResource DrawChoiceButton}"
                                 Content="{x:Static reader:ReaderStrings.DrawInkLabel}"
                                 Tag="ink" GroupName="DrawTool" IsChecked="True"
                                 Checked="OnDrawToolChecked" />
                    <RadioButton Style="{StaticResource DrawChoiceButton}"
                                 Content="{x:Static reader:ReaderStrings.DrawSquareLabel}"
                                 Tag="square" GroupName="DrawTool" Checked="OnDrawToolChecked" />
                    <RadioButton Style="{StaticResource DrawChoiceButton}"
                                 Content="{x:Static reader:ReaderStrings.DrawCircleLabel}"
                                 Tag="circle" GroupName="DrawTool" Checked="OnDrawToolChecked" />
                    <RadioButton Style="{StaticResource DrawChoiceButton}"
                                 Content="{x:Static reader:ReaderStrings.DrawLineLabel}"
                                 Tag="line" GroupName="DrawTool" Checked="OnDrawToolChecked" />
                    <RadioButton Style="{StaticResource DrawChoiceButton}"
                                 Content="{x:Static reader:ReaderStrings.DrawArrowLabel}"
                                 Tag="arrow" GroupName="DrawTool" Checked="OnDrawToolChecked" />
                    <!-- V4 T4：图章（拖拽确定位置与大小）。预置 14 种，或选一张图片作图片图章。 -->
                    <RadioButton x:Name="StampToolButton"
                                 Style="{StaticResource DrawChoiceButton}"
                                 Content="{x:Static reader:ReaderStrings.DrawStampLabel}"
                                 Tag="stamp" GroupName="DrawTool" Checked="OnDrawToolChecked" />
                    <ComboBox x:Name="StampPresetBox"
                              Width="132"
                              Height="26"
                              Margin="4,0,0,0"
                              VerticalAlignment="Center"
                              VerticalContentAlignment="Center"
                              ItemsSource="{x:Static annotations:StampPresets.All}"
                              DisplayMemberPath="Label"
                              SelectedIndex="0"
                              SelectionChanged="OnStampPresetChanged"
                              ToolTip="{x:Static reader:ReaderStrings.StampPresetToolTip}" />
                    <Button x:Name="StampImageButton"
                            Height="26"
                            Margin="4,0,0,0"
                            Padding="8,0"
                            Cursor="Hand"
                            Content="{x:Static reader:ReaderStrings.StampPickImage}"
                            Click="OnStampImageClick"
                            ToolTip="{x:Static reader:ReaderStrings.StampPickImageToolTip}" />
                    <Border Width="1" Margin="6,4" Background="{DynamicResource Brush.Border}" />
                    <TextBlock Text="{x:Static reader:ReaderStrings.DrawColorTitle}"
                               Style="{StaticResource FieldHint}"
                               VerticalAlignment="Center" />
                    <RadioButton Style="{StaticResource DrawColorSwatch}"
                                 Background="#000000" Tag="#000000" GroupName="DrawColor"
                                 IsChecked="True" Checked="OnDrawColorChecked" ToolTip="黑色" />
                    <RadioButton Style="{StaticResource DrawColorSwatch}"
                                 Background="#FFFF00" Tag="#FFFF00" GroupName="DrawColor"
                                 Checked="OnDrawColorChecked" ToolTip="黄色" />
                    <RadioButton Style="{StaticResource DrawColorSwatch}"
                                 Background="#A6E22E" Tag="#A6E22E" GroupName="DrawColor"
                                 Checked="OnDrawColorChecked" ToolTip="绿色" />
                    <RadioButton Style="{StaticResource DrawColorSwatch}"
                                 Background="#5AC8FA" Tag="#5AC8FA" GroupName="DrawColor"
                                 Checked="OnDrawColorChecked" ToolTip="蓝色" />
                    <RadioButton Style="{StaticResource DrawColorSwatch}"
                                 Background="#FF9EC4" Tag="#FF9EC4" GroupName="DrawColor"
                                 Checked="OnDrawColorChecked" ToolTip="粉色" />
                    <Border Width="1" Margin="6,4" Background="{DynamicResource Brush.Border}" />
                    <TextBlock Text="{x:Static reader:ReaderStrings.DrawWidthTitle}"
                               Style="{StaticResource FieldHint}"
                               VerticalAlignment="Center" />
                    <RadioButton Style="{StaticResource DrawChoiceButton}"
                                 Content="{x:Static reader:ReaderStrings.DrawThinLabel}"
                                 Tag="1" GroupName="DrawWidth" Checked="OnDrawWidthChecked" />
                    <RadioButton Style="{StaticResource DrawChoiceButton}"
                                 Content="{x:Static reader:ReaderStrings.DrawMidLabel}"
                                 Tag="2" GroupName="DrawWidth" IsChecked="True" Checked="OnDrawWidthChecked" />
                    <RadioButton Style="{StaticResource DrawChoiceButton}"
                                 Content="{x:Static reader:ReaderStrings.DrawThickLabel}"
                                 Tag="4" GroupName="DrawWidth" Checked="OnDrawWidthChecked" />
                </StackPanel>
            </Border>

            <!-- ============ V4 T8 朗读条（左下）============
                 系统本地语音合成（System.Speech），不联网、不上传文本；无可用语音时由宿主禁用并提示。
                 进度经 SpeakProgress 的字符区间映射到页内矩形（SpeechRects 叠加层）并自动翻页/滚动。 -->
            <Border x:Name="SpeechBar"
                    Style="{StaticResource DrawToolbarPanel}"
                    HorizontalAlignment="Left"
                    VerticalAlignment="Bottom"
                    Margin="12,0,0,12"
                    Padding="8,6"
                    Panel.ZIndex="6"
                    ToolTip="{x:Static reader:ReaderStrings.SpeechToolTip}">
                <StackPanel Orientation="Horizontal" VerticalAlignment="Center">
                    <TextBlock Text="{x:Static reader:ReaderStrings.SpeechPlay}"
                               Style="{StaticResource FieldHint}"
                               VerticalAlignment="Center"
                               Margin="2,0,8,0" />
                    <Button x:Name="SpeechToggleButton"
                            Height="26"
                            Padding="10,0"
                            Cursor="Hand"
                            IsEnabled="{Binding SpeechAvailable}"
                            Content="{Binding SpeechToggleLabel}"
                            Click="OnSpeechToggleClick" />
                    <Button x:Name="SpeechStopButton"
                            Height="26"
                            Margin="6,0,0,0"
                            Padding="10,0"
                            Cursor="Hand"
                            IsEnabled="{Binding SpeechStopEnabled}"
                            Content="{x:Static reader:ReaderStrings.SpeechStop}"
                            Click="OnSpeechStopClick" />
                    <Border Width="1" Margin="8,4" Background="{DynamicResource Brush.Border}" />
                    <TextBlock Text="{x:Static reader:ReaderStrings.SpeechRateTitle}"
                               Style="{StaticResource FieldHint}"
                               VerticalAlignment="Center" />
                    <ComboBox x:Name="SpeechRateBox"
                              Width="86"
                              Height="26"
                              Margin="6,0,0,0"
                              VerticalContentAlignment="Center"
                              SelectedIndex="1"
                              SelectionChanged="OnSpeechRateChanged">
                        <ComboBoxItem Content="{x:Static reader:ReaderStrings.SpeechRateSlow}" Tag="-4" />
                        <ComboBoxItem Content="{x:Static reader:ReaderStrings.SpeechRateNormal}" Tag="0" />
                        <ComboBoxItem Content="{x:Static reader:ReaderStrings.SpeechRateFast}" Tag="4" />
                    </ComboBox>
                </StackPanel>
            </Border>

            <!-- ============ V4 T9 批注属性面板（右侧浮动，随选中出现）============
                 对标 Foxit 的 Format 面板：选中批注后**持续**可调颜色 / 线宽 / 不透明度
                 （此前只有一次性浮菜单）。改动经 VM.Changed → ReaderViewModel.UpdateAnnotation
                 走既有保存链路（防抖 + 快速通道），不新增引擎动作类型。 -->
            <Border x:Name="AnnotationPropertiesPanel"
                    Style="{StaticResource DrawToolbarPanel}"
                    HorizontalAlignment="Right"
                    VerticalAlignment="Top"
                    Margin="0,64,12,0"
                    Padding="10,8"
                    Width="190"
                    Panel.ZIndex="6"
                    DataContext="{Binding Properties}"
                    Visibility="{Binding IsVisible, Converter={StaticResource BoolToVisibility}}">
                <StackPanel Orientation="Vertical">
                    <Grid Margin="0,0,0,6">
                        <TextBlock Text="{x:Static reader:ReaderStrings.PropertiesTitle}"
                                   FontWeight="Bold"
                                   VerticalAlignment="Center"
                                   Foreground="{DynamicResource Brush.TextPrimary}" />
                        <Button Content="✕"
                                HorizontalAlignment="Right"
                                Padding="4,0"
                                Cursor="Hand"
                                Click="OnPropertiesDismissClick"
                                ToolTip="{x:Static reader:ReaderStrings.PropertiesCloseToolTip}" />
                    </Grid>

                    <TextBlock Text="{x:Static reader:ReaderStrings.PropertiesColor}"
                               Style="{StaticResource FieldHint}" />
                    <ItemsControl ItemsSource="{x:Static vm:AnnotationPropertiesViewModel.Palette}"
                                  Margin="0,4,0,6">
                        <ItemsControl.ItemsPanel>
                            <ItemsPanelTemplate>
                                <WrapPanel />
                            </ItemsPanelTemplate>
                        </ItemsControl.ItemsPanel>
                        <ItemsControl.ItemTemplate>
                            <DataTemplate>
                                <Button Width="24"
                                        Height="24"
                                        Margin="0,0,6,6"
                                        Padding="0"
                                        Cursor="Hand"
                                        Tag="{Binding}"
                                        Click="OnPropertiesColorClick">
                                    <Border Width="14"
                                            Height="14"
                                            CornerRadius="3"
                                            BorderBrush="{DynamicResource Brush.BorderStrong}"
                                            BorderThickness="1"
                                            Background="{Binding}" />
                                </Button>
                            </DataTemplate>
                        </ItemsControl.ItemTemplate>
                    </ItemsControl>

                    <StackPanel Visibility="{Binding SupportsLineWidth, Converter={StaticResource BoolToVisibility}}">
                        <TextBlock Text="{x:Static reader:ReaderStrings.PropertiesWidth}"
                                   Style="{StaticResource FieldHint}" />
                        <ComboBox x:Name="PropertiesWidthBox"
                                  Height="26"
                                  Margin="0,4,0,6"
                                  VerticalContentAlignment="Center"
                                  SelectedIndex="1"
                                  SelectionChanged="OnPropertiesWidthChanged">
                            <ComboBoxItem Content="{x:Static reader:ReaderStrings.DrawThinLabel}" Tag="1" />
                            <ComboBoxItem Content="{x:Static reader:ReaderStrings.DrawMidLabel}" Tag="2" />
                            <ComboBoxItem Content="{x:Static reader:ReaderStrings.DrawThickLabel}" Tag="4" />
                        </ComboBox>
                    </StackPanel>

                    <StackPanel Visibility="{Binding SupportsOpacity, Converter={StaticResource BoolToVisibility}}">
                        <TextBlock Text="{x:Static reader:ReaderStrings.PropertiesOpacity}"
                                   Style="{StaticResource FieldHint}" />
                        <ComboBox x:Name="PropertiesOpacityBox"
                                  Height="26"
                                  Margin="0,4,0,0"
                                  VerticalContentAlignment="Center"
                                  SelectedIndex="1"
                                  SelectionChanged="OnPropertiesOpacityChanged">
                            <ComboBoxItem Content="{x:Static reader:ReaderStrings.PropertiesOpacity25}" Tag="0.25" />
                            <ComboBoxItem Content="{x:Static reader:ReaderStrings.PropertiesOpacity50}" Tag="0.5" />
                            <ComboBoxItem Content="{x:Static reader:ReaderStrings.PropertiesOpacity75}" Tag="0.75" />
                            <ComboBoxItem Content="{x:Static reader:ReaderStrings.PropertiesOpacity100}" Tag="1.0" />
                        </ComboBox>
                    </StackPanel>
                </StackPanel>
            </Border>

            <!-- ============ T2 选中浮菜单（复制/高亮/笔记/用工具处理▾；含工具子菜单）============ -->
            <Popup x:Name="SelectionPopup"
                   AllowsTransparency="True"
                   StaysOpen="False"
                   Placement="Relative"
                   PlacementTarget="{Binding ElementName=ScrollHost}"
                   PopupAnimation="Fade"
                   Closed="OnSelectionPopupClosed">
                <Border Style="{StaticResource FlyoutPanel}">
                    <Grid>
                        <!-- 主菜单 -->
                        <StackPanel x:Name="SelectionMainPanel" Orientation="Vertical">
                            <!-- v1.1 T14：划词浮出「译」按钮（仅点击才翻译；≥2 字才可用，见 code-behind） -->
                            <Button x:Name="TranslateSelectionButton"
                                    Style="{StaticResource MenuItemButton}"
                                    Click="OnTranslateSelectionClick"
                                    ToolTip="{x:Static reader:ReaderStrings.TranslateToolTip}"
                                    AutomationProperties.Name="{x:Static reader:ReaderStrings.MenuTranslate}">
                                <StackPanel Orientation="Horizontal" VerticalAlignment="Center">
                                    <Border Width="24"
                                            Height="24"
                                            CornerRadius="6"
                                            Background="{DynamicResource Brush.Accent}">
                                        <TextBlock Text="译"
                                                   FontSize="13"
                                                   FontWeight="Bold"
                                                   HorizontalAlignment="Center"
                                                   VerticalAlignment="Center"
                                                   Foreground="{DynamicResource Brush.OnAccent}" />
                                    </Border>
                                    <TextBlock Text="{x:Static reader:ReaderStrings.MenuTranslate}"
                                               Margin="9,0,0,0"
                                               VerticalAlignment="Center" />
                                </StackPanel>
                            </Button>
                            <Separator Margin="4,3" />
                            <Button Style="{StaticResource MenuItemButton}"
                                    Content="{x:Static reader:ReaderStrings.MenuCopy}"
                                    Click="OnCopyClick" />
                            <Button Style="{StaticResource MenuItemButton}"
                                    Content="{x:Static reader:ReaderStrings.MenuHighlight}"
                                    Click="OnHighlightClick" />
                            <Button Style="{StaticResource MenuItemButton}"
                                    Content="{x:Static reader:ReaderStrings.MenuNote}"
                                    Click="OnNoteClick" />
                            <!-- V4 T3：文本标记（下划线/删除线） -->
                            <Button Style="{StaticResource MenuItemButton}"
                                    Content="{x:Static reader:ReaderStrings.MenuUnderline}"
                                    Click="OnUnderlineClick" />
                            <Button Style="{StaticResource MenuItemButton}"
                                    Content="{x:Static reader:ReaderStrings.MenuStrikeout}"
                                    Click="OnStrikeoutClick" />
                            <Separator Margin="4,3" />
                            <Button Style="{StaticResource MenuItemButton}"
                                    Content="{x:Static reader:ReaderStrings.MenuTools}"
                                    Click="OnToolsClick" />
                        </StackPanel>

                        <!-- 工具子菜单 -->
                        <StackPanel x:Name="SelectionToolPanel" Orientation="Vertical" Visibility="Collapsed">
                            <Button x:Name="ToolCompressButton"
                                    Style="{StaticResource MenuItemButton}"
                                    Content="压缩 PDF"
                                    Click="OnToolItemClick" Tag="compress" />
                            <Button x:Name="ToolSplitButton"
                                    Style="{StaticResource MenuItemButton}"
                                    Content="拆分 PDF"
                                    Click="OnToolItemClick" Tag="split" />
                            <Button x:Name="ToolRotateButton"
                                    Style="{StaticResource MenuItemButton}"
                                    Content="旋转 PDF"
                                    Click="OnToolItemClick" Tag="rotate" />
                            <Button x:Name="ToolWordButton"
                                    Style="{StaticResource MenuItemButton}"
                                    Content="转 Word"
                                    Click="OnToolItemClick" Tag="pdf_to_word" />
                            <Separator Margin="4,3" />
                            <Button Style="{StaticResource MenuItemButton}"
                                    Content="{x:Static reader:ReaderStrings.MenuMoreTools}"
                                    Click="OnMoreToolsClick" />
                            <Button Style="{StaticResource MenuItemButton}"
                                    Content="{x:Static reader:ReaderStrings.MenuBack}"
                                    Click="OnMenuBackClick" />
                        </StackPanel>
                    </Grid>
                </Border>
            </Popup>

            <!-- ============ T2 悬停操作条（编辑/删除/改色；FR-13/H-9）============ -->
            <Popup x:Name="HoverPopup"
                   AllowsTransparency="True"
                   StaysOpen="True"
                   Placement="Relative"
                   PlacementTarget="{Binding ElementName=ScrollHost}"
                   PopupAnimation="Fade"
                   Closed="OnHoverPopupClosed">
                <Border Style="{StaticResource FlyoutPanel}"
                        MouseEnter="OnHoverPopupMouseEnter"
                        MouseLeave="OnHoverPopupMouseLeave">
                    <Grid>
                        <StackPanel x:Name="HoverMainPanel" Orientation="Vertical">
                            <Button x:Name="HoverEditButton"
                                    Style="{StaticResource MenuItemButton}"
                                    Content="{x:Static reader:ReaderStrings.HoverEdit}"
                                    Click="OnHoverEditClick" />
                            <Button Style="{StaticResource MenuItemButton}"
                                    Content="{x:Static reader:ReaderStrings.HoverDelete}"
                                    Click="OnHoverDeleteClick" />
                            <Button Style="{StaticResource MenuItemButton}"
                                    Content="{x:Static reader:ReaderStrings.HoverRecolor}"
                                    Click="OnHoverRecolorClick" />
                        </StackPanel>

                        <StackPanel x:Name="HoverColorPanel" Orientation="Vertical" Visibility="Collapsed">
                            <TextBlock Text="{x:Static reader:ReaderStrings.ColorPanelTitle}"
                                       Style="{StaticResource FieldHint}"
                                       Margin="8,4,8,6" />
                            <StackPanel Orientation="Horizontal" Margin="4,0,4,6">
                                <Button Style="{StaticResource ColorSwatchButton}"
                                        Background="#FFFF00" Tag="#FFFF00"
                                        ToolTip="黄色" Click="OnColorSwatchClick" />
                                <Button Style="{StaticResource ColorSwatchButton}"
                                        Background="#A6E22E" Tag="#A6E22E"
                                        ToolTip="绿色" Click="OnColorSwatchClick" />
                                <Button Style="{StaticResource ColorSwatchButton}"
                                        Background="#5AC8FA" Tag="#5AC8FA"
                                        ToolTip="蓝色" Click="OnColorSwatchClick" />
                                <Button Style="{StaticResource ColorSwatchButton}"
                                        Background="#FF9EC4" Tag="#FF9EC4"
                                        ToolTip="粉色" Click="OnColorSwatchClick" />
                            </StackPanel>
                            <Button Style="{StaticResource MenuItemButton}"
                                    Content="{x:Static reader:ReaderStrings.MenuBack}"
                                    Click="OnMenuBackClick" />
                        </StackPanel>
                    </Grid>
                </Border>
            </Popup>

            <!-- ============ T2 笔记输入弹层 ============ -->
            <Popup x:Name="NotePopup"
                   AllowsTransparency="True"
                   StaysOpen="True"
                   Placement="Relative"
                   PlacementTarget="{Binding ElementName=ScrollHost}"
                   PopupAnimation="Fade">
                <Border Style="{StaticResource FlyoutPanel}" Padding="10">
                    <StackPanel Width="264">
                        <TextBlock Text="{x:Static reader:ReaderStrings.NoteEditorTitle}"
                                   Style="{StaticResource FieldLabel}"
                                   Margin="0,0,0,6" />
                        <TextBox x:Name="NoteBox"
                                 Style="{StaticResource FieldTextBox}"
                                 AcceptsReturn="True"
                                 TextWrapping="Wrap"
                                 Height="92"
                                 VerticalScrollBarVisibility="Auto" />
                        <StackPanel Orientation="Horizontal" HorizontalAlignment="Right" Margin="0,8,0,0">
                            <Button Style="{StaticResource SecondaryButton}"
                                    Content="{x:Static reader:ReaderStrings.Cancel}"
                                    Click="OnNoteCancelClick" />
                            <Button Style="{StaticResource PrimaryButton}"
                                    Margin="8,0,0,0"
                                    Content="{x:Static reader:ReaderStrings.Confirm}"
                                    Click="OnNoteConfirmClick" />
                        </StackPanel>
                    </StackPanel>
                </Border>
            </Popup>

            <!-- ============ T2 Toast（复制反馈等，2s 自动消失）============ -->
            <Border x:Name="Toast"
                    HorizontalAlignment="Center"
                    VerticalAlignment="Bottom"
                    Margin="0,0,0,24"
                    Padding="14,7"
                    CornerRadius="6"
                    Background="{DynamicResource Brush.TextPrimary}"
                    Opacity="0.92"
                    Visibility="Collapsed"
                    IsHitTestVisible="False">
                <TextBlock x:Name="ToastText"
                           Foreground="{DynamicResource Brush.OnAccent}"
                           FontSize="12" />
            </Border>

            <!-- ============ V4 Option 3：加密文档锁定遮罩 ============
                 未解锁时不打开文档 / 不解密 / 不渲染任何页；此处以遮罩替代内容区。
                 「解锁」仅发事件，密码流程（复用 ST-04 对话框）与凭据驻留由宿主负责。 -->
            <Border x:Name="LockOverlay"
                    Panel.ZIndex="10"
                    Background="{DynamicResource Brush.OverlayMask}">
                <Border.Style>
                    <Style TargetType="Border">
                        <Setter Property="Visibility" Value="Collapsed" />
                        <Style.Triggers>
                            <DataTrigger Binding="{Binding IsLocked}" Value="True">
                                <Setter Property="Visibility" Value="Visible" />
                            </DataTrigger>
                        </Style.Triggers>
                    </Style>
                </Border.Style>
                <StackPanel HorizontalAlignment="Center" VerticalAlignment="Center" MaxWidth="440">
                    <TextBlock Text="🔒"
                               FontSize="40"
                               HorizontalAlignment="Center" />
                    <TextBlock Text="{x:Static reader:ReaderStrings.LockedTitle}"
                               Style="{StaticResource SectionTitle}"
                               HorizontalAlignment="Center"
                               Margin="0,8,0,0" />
                    <TextBlock Text="{x:Static reader:ReaderStrings.LockedHint}"
                               Style="{StaticResource FieldHint}"
                               TextWrapping="Wrap"
                               TextAlignment="Center"
                               HorizontalAlignment="Center"
                               Margin="0,8,0,0" />
                    <Button Content="{x:Static reader:ReaderStrings.UnlockButton}"
                            Style="{StaticResource PrimaryButton}"
                            MinWidth="96"
                            HorizontalAlignment="Center"
                            Margin="0,16,0,0"
                            Click="OnUnlockClick" />
                </StackPanel>
            </Border>
        </Grid>

        <!-- ============ 错误条（ST-06 加载失败 / 渲染失败汇总） ============ -->
        <Border Grid.Row="1"
                Background="{DynamicResource Brush.FieldBackground}"
                BorderBrush="{DynamicResource Brush.Border}"
                BorderThickness="0,1,0,0"
                Padding="12,6">
            <Border.Style>
                <Style TargetType="Border">
                    <Setter Property="Visibility" Value="Collapsed" />
                    <Style.Triggers>
                        <DataTrigger Binding="{Binding HasError}" Value="True">
                            <Setter Property="Visibility" Value="Visible" />
                        </DataTrigger>
                    </Style.Triggers>
                </Style>
            </Border.Style>
            <TextBlock Text="{Binding ErrorMessage}"
                       Style="{StaticResource ErrorText}"
                       TextWrapping="Wrap" />
        </Border>

        <!-- A+C 方案 A（底栏合一）：原「页码跳转 + 缩放控制」底栏已移入主窗口状态栏
             （MainWindow.xaml 的 StatusReaderCluster），阅读视图不再自带第二条状态栏。
             页码跳转 Enter/Esc、Ctrl+G 定位、非法页码抖动一并移到 MainWindow.xaml.cs。 -->
    </Grid>
</UserControl>
